# Project wordlist for hunspell, loaded alongside fa_IR and en_US.
#
# The first line must be a number -- hunspell reads it as the expected entry
# count. It does not have to be exact, but it has to be there.
#
# Add a word here only when it is genuinely correct and the dictionary does
# not know it: transliterated Chinese and Sanskrit names, Buddhist technical
# vocabulary, and place names. Do not add a word to silence a real typo.
#
# One word per line. Keep it sorted so diffs stay readable.
